# Keep the run corpus out of the build context.
#
# Measured before this file existed: the whole tree is 2.83 GB and 2.63 GB of
# that is .prothesis/runs, which the image has no use for. OQ-068 recorded the
# same mistake on the fixture image, where the corpus inside the build context
# cost gigabytes of build cache per world. The fix there was
# testdata/kvfixture/.dockerignore; this is the same fix for the harness image.
**/.prothesis/runs/
**/.prothesis/*.csv
**/.prothesis/*.json
**/.prothesis/*.yaml.report

# Build outputs. The image builds its own binaries; a host binary here would be
# the wrong architecture and would silently bloat the context.
bin/
**/bin/
*.exe

.git/
.github/

# Scratch and editor state.
*.log
.vscode/
.idea/
